(3744668, 527740, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wanted to get my comment in before this potentially gets DQ''ed. The title itself is truly absurd. I mean why have that large of a title? Why make it all one word? It begs the question why? I love how it changes the column size of the voting page, so it makes this photo stand out from all the others even before you see it. Now the photo itself? I''m not quite sure what to say. So minimalistic, yet it has so much to say. Yet, I don''t think this is what you were going for, I think you entering this to see people''s reactions. I''m excited to see the potential controversy this photo will stir up. Not only the idea of it being a "photo" but also the absurdity of the title. This piece of art truly exceeds the challenge topic.</td>', 'Wanted to get my comment in before this potentially gets DQ''ed. The title itself is truly absurd. I mean why have that large of a title? Why make it all one word? It begs the question why? I love how it changes the column size of the voting page, so it makes this photo stand out from all the others even before you see it. Now the photo itself? I''m not quite sure what to say. So minimalistic, yet it has so much to say. Yet, I don''t think this is what you were going for, I think you entering this to see people''s reactions. I''m excited to see the potential controversy this photo will stir up. Not only the idea of it being a "photo" but also the absurdity of the title. This piece of art truly exceeds the challenge topic.', '2007-06-06 01:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
