(3746597, 528975, 39057, '<td valign="top">I wonder what he would have said if you went up to him and said, "I have a job for you for 30 days. It pays $15.00 hour. Before I pay you, you need to have your SS #/card. They will take taxes out of your check for federal, state and FICA. You will clear about $10.00 hour. Are you willing to work for the money and pay your taxes like the majority of law abiding citizens?"<br/> <br/>I had a lawn business in New Orleans before the storm. When I''d see people like this I''d ask them if they wanted to spend the day cutting grass with me. The answer was always NO !  Not one time did I get one of these guys to work for the money...not one !<br/> <br/>So IMO it is not "the richest country in the world''s" fault that this guy is sitting on the bench. <br/> <br/>BTW...it is a good picture...I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I wonder what he would have said if you went up to him and said, "I have a job for you for 30 days. It pays $15.00 hour. Before I pay you, you need to have your SS #/card. They will take taxes out of your check for federal, state and FICA. You will clear about $10.00 hour. Are you willing to work for the money and pay your taxes like the majority of law abiding citizens?" I had a lawn business in New Orleans before the storm. When I''d see people like this I''d ask them if they wanted to spend the day cutting grass with me. The answer was always NO !  Not one time did I get one of these guys to work for the money...not one ! So IMO it is not "the richest country in the world''s" fault that this guy is sitting on the bench.  BTW...it is a good picture...I gave it an 8.', '2007-06-06 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
