(3747634, 526331, 62671, '<td valign="top">wow those eyes are blue!  the pink ears and nose contrast with the blues and the overall shades of the image work well together.  Focus and composition is done well.  It looks so intense!  I''m sure you heard this already, but I wish the ears were not cropped off.</td>', 'wow those eyes are blue!  the pink ears and nose contrast with the blues and the overall shades of the image work well together.  Focus and composition is done well.  It looks so intense!  I''m sure you heard this already, but I wish the ears were not cropped off.', '2007-06-06 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
