(3747884, 525523, 35947, '<td valign="top">What a cute face with such sad eyes!  I really like the BW here, it helps bring forward the bleakness.  Only wish the ear wasn''t cropped at the top.  From the way I am reading your title, I believe that this is a pound puppy that was deserted.  If you had a cage that would really bring that point across better, but then again I could be wrong!  Very haunting photo.  Excellent work.</td>', 'What a cute face with such sad eyes!  I really like the BW here, it helps bring forward the bleakness.  Only wish the ear wasn''t cropped at the top.  From the way I am reading your title, I believe that this is a pound puppy that was deserted.  If you had a cage that would really bring that point across better, but then again I could be wrong!  Very haunting photo.  Excellent work.', '2007-06-06 16:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747895, 528706, 35947, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective and angle.  Nice choice of duotone.</td>', 'Excellent perspective and angle.  Nice choice of duotone.', '2007-06-06 16:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
