(3747921, 528449, 62671, '<td valign="top">Adorable baby!  such inquisitive expression.   I am not crazy about the lighting, nor the grass in the foreground.  They are distracting.  Momma pony is do dark in the face. I would dodge some detail back in where her eyes are. <br/>fill flash would have helped.  There is also some weird object in the trees to the right of the  baby and the stuff under mommas belly that I would get rid of as well.   B&amp;W works pretty good here,  gives a great contrast to babies coat.<br/>I would also clone out the halter ring that is hanging below babies mouth.  looks like he is chewing on it.</td>', 'Adorable baby!  such inquisitive expression.   I am not crazy about the lighting, nor the grass in the foreground.  They are distracting.  Momma pony is do dark in the face. I would dodge some detail back in where her eyes are. fill flash would have helped.  There is also some weird object in the trees to the right of the  baby and the stuff under mommas belly that I would get rid of as well.   B&W works pretty good here,  gives a great contrast to babies coat.I would also clone out the halter ring that is hanging below babies mouth.  looks like he is chewing on it.', '2007-06-06 16:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
