(3752310, 528844, 79242, '<td valign="top">I like it.... The barn and the clouds seem to balance one another out well. The colors contrast nicely. I am not sure why, but the horizon feels a little crooked to me....I do not feel like taking the time to check though :P Overall, one of the best I have seen so far 8<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'I like it.... The barn and the clouds seem to balance one another out well. The colors contrast nicely. I am not sure why, but the horizon feels a little crooked to me....I do not feel like taking the time to check though :P Overall, one of the best I have seen so far 8 I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 15:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752328, 526205, 79242, '<td valign="top">The bottoe 2/3 if the photo are very nice. The top 1/3 not as much. I think the horizon is a little crooked too (Although this is the second photo in a row that I have felt that, so maybe I am crooked. Above average IMO<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'The bottoe 2/3 if the photo are very nice. The top 1/3 not as much. I think the horizon is a little crooked too (Although this is the second photo in a row that I have felt that, so maybe I am crooked. Above average IMO I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752340, 527864, 79242, '<td valign="top">Good picture.... Nice DOF, good composition..... My only complaint (And it is minor) is that the background color is very similar to the subject color. Good for predators, bad for photographs.<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'Good picture.... Nice DOF, good composition..... My only complaint (And it is minor) is that the background color is very similar to the subject color. Good for predators, bad for photographs. I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752349, 528935, 79242, '<td valign="top">Cute, but too much front light on the subject. Washes out his features.<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'Cute, but too much front light on the subject. Washes out his features. I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 16:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752451, 528446, 35994, '<td valign="top">I really really love this photo. It brings attention to a very important issue &amp; I love the effect of the glass (shower door I''m guessing?). Awesome shot, hope to see it do well! 10 from me, good luck!</td>', 'I really really love this photo. It brings attention to a very important issue & I love the effect of the glass (shower door I''m guessing?). Awesome shot, hope to see it do well! 10 from me, good luck!', '2007-06-07 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752465, 528207, 43565, '<td valign="top">You have taken an "ordinary" shot and made it into so much more.  I think the grain works well with the emotion you are conveying.</td>', 'You have taken an "ordinary" shot and made it into so much more.  I think the grain works well with the emotion you are conveying.', '2007-06-07 16:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752481, 526317, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would try cropping above the top trees.  I really like the silhouette.</td>', 'I would try cropping above the top trees.  I really like the silhouette.', '2007-06-07 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752482, 528946, 62187, '<td valign="top">''why must we pay to drink'' - I think it''s probably the cost from getting it from point ''A'' to point ''B''. And for filtering out all the bad stuff we put in it. Also, it''s not everywhere. Where I live (which is not really ''Unknown''), it rains an average of 4 inches a year. Anyway, I like your photo. I''m wondering if you actually used a flash or had some extra lighting? Maybe something added in photoshop? I''ll go with an 8 and wonder why somebody asked for validation. Strange to me.</td>', '''why must we pay to drink'' - I think it''s probably the cost from getting it from point ''A'' to point ''B''. And for filtering out all the bad stuff we put in it. Also, it''s not everywhere. Where I live (which is not really ''Unknown''), it rains an average of 4 inches a year. Anyway, I like your photo. I''m wondering if you actually used a flash or had some extra lighting? Maybe something added in photoshop? I''ll go with an 8 and wonder why somebody asked for validation. Strange to me.', '2007-06-07 16:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752492, 527945, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sweet, he rides a Polaris. I got one too! (Removing sensor dust in basic edit is allowed I''m pretty sure)</td>', 'Sweet, he rides a Polaris. I got one too! (Removing sensor dust in basic edit is allowed I''m pretty sure)', '2007-06-07 16:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752516, 525936, 76217, '<td valign="top">It might help if I knew what that orange thing was. Is this guy supposed to be a victim of a fire or an arsonist?</td>', 'It might help if I knew what that orange thing was. Is this guy supposed to be a victim of a fire or an arsonist?', '2007-06-07 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752524, 528930, 62187, '<td valign="top">Alrighty then! Excellent photo quality, focus, lighting and all that cr*p. Too funny! Why comment when I should be checking the ''10''? 10...there!</td>', 'Alrighty then! Excellent photo quality, focus, lighting and all that cr*p. Too funny! Why comment when I should be checking the ''10''? 10...there!', '2007-06-07 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752533, 526508, 62187, '<td valign="top">At least he''s not throwing poo! Very nice photo quality. 9</td>', 'At least he''s not throwing poo! Very nice photo quality. 9', '2007-06-07 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752538, 528826, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it''s much better (I think) then the others I saw in that challenge.</td>', 'Yeah, it''s much better (I think) then the others I saw in that challenge.', '2007-06-07 16:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752540, 528925, 62187, '<td valign="top">Why not a 10? Ok...10!</td>', 'Why not a 10? Ok...10!', '2007-06-07 16:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752545, 528975, 76217, '<td valign="top">Dispensing with your politics, good homeless guy photo.</td>', 'Dispensing with your politics, good homeless guy photo.', '2007-06-07 16:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752563, 527942, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish you had included the head.</td>', 'I wish you had included the head.', '2007-06-07 17:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752570, 528449, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I don''t like the title.</td>', 'Nice picture but I don''t like the title.', '2007-06-07 17:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752572, 528446, 62187, '<td valign="top">Why? Because we''re still not as civilized as we probably think we are. I love the photo part, I''m thinking it was taken thru glass like a shower door - but the sign? Well, I guess that''s part of your message which is a powerful topic. I''m gonna have to disregard it as distracting but go with a 9.</td>', 'Why? Because we''re still not as civilized as we probably think we are. I love the photo part, I''m thinking it was taken thru glass like a shower door - but the sign? Well, I guess that''s part of your message which is a powerful topic. I''m gonna have to disregard it as distracting but go with a 9.', '2007-06-07 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752575, 526141, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, maybe a closer zoom of the kid would have made more of an impact, and what''s with the title? "Why did you leave me?" surely...</td>', 'Nice pic, maybe a closer zoom of the kid would have made more of an impact, and what''s with the title? "Why did you leave me?" surely...', '2007-06-07 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752578, 524761, 76217, '<td valign="top">Nice but I''m not sure I get the point. Air pollution can be pretty?</td>', 'Nice but I''m not sure I get the point. Air pollution can be pretty?', '2007-06-07 17:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752579, 527626, 78062, '<td valign="top">Odd... needs to be darker I think to make it a little ''darker'' in the metaphorical/allegorical sense.</td>', 'Odd... needs to be darker I think to make it a little ''darker'' in the metaphorical/allegorical sense.', '2007-06-07 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752580, 528286, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''d gladly give up my aisle seat if you wanna switch! I think it''s an awesome photo. Maybe just a tad too blue which I think could have been removed even in basic edit - I think? I''ll go with an 8.</td>', 'I''d gladly give up my aisle seat if you wanna switch! I think it''s an awesome photo. Maybe just a tad too blue which I think could have been removed even in basic edit - I think? I''ll go with an 8.', '2007-06-07 17:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752581, 528861, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice imagination.</td>', 'Nice imagination.', '2007-06-07 17:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752584, 528861, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had to take a ''double take'' of this photo - too funny - again!</td>', 'I had to take a ''double take'' of this photo - too funny - again!', '2007-06-07 17:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752585, 528762, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, needs some more contrast to push it a bit more though.</td>', 'Nice pic, needs some more contrast to push it a bit more though.', '2007-06-07 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752590, 529278, 78062, '<td valign="top">Good image but I think the bit past the feet should have been cropped as it''s just empty space.</td>', 'Good image but I think the bit past the feet should have been cropped as it''s just empty space.', '2007-06-07 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
