(3752629, 528082, 78062, '<td valign="top">Needs that bar on the right cropped out, a little more contrast and I''m not too sure of the title... it seems like it''s trying to incite pity, to me of course.</td>', 'Needs that bar on the right cropped out, a little more contrast and I''m not too sure of the title... it seems like it''s trying to incite pity, to me of course.', '2007-06-07 17:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752630, 528476, 78062, '<td valign="top">I think you picked the wrong colour for the border.</td>', 'I think you picked the wrong colour for the border.', '2007-06-07 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752635, 525387, 78062, '<td valign="top">Why oh why would anyone want to be like the Olsen twins? Isn''t that like saying they want to be like Paris Hilton?</td>', 'Why oh why would anyone want to be like the Olsen twins? Isn''t that like saying they want to be like Paris Hilton?', '2007-06-07 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752640, 528432, 78062, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. Very Nine Inch Nails. The black ant and the white feather are great natural contrasts, in colour and in life.</td>', 'Cool picture. Very Nine Inch Nails. The black ant and the white feather are great natural contrasts, in colour and in life.', '2007-06-07 17:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752645, 529303, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Looks like Beaver Lake, NY. But I don''t like the title one bit. It doesn''t look like a ''God'' theme to me, more of an expanse, infinite questions, great unexpored horizons/futures... not desolation and loneliness.<br/> <br/>Good effort.</td>', 'Nice picture. Looks like Beaver Lake, NY. But I don''t like the title one bit. It doesn''t look like a ''God'' theme to me, more of an expanse, infinite questions, great unexpored horizons/futures... not desolation and loneliness. Good effort.', '2007-06-07 17:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752650, 528614, 78062, '<td valign="top">Outstanding clouds, very (dare I say it) Ansel Adams style.<br/> <br/>Please explain how you got the picture to look this way. I''ve been trying for ages to get this perfect exposure/contrast/dof/clouds etc.</td>', 'Outstanding clouds, very (dare I say it) Ansel Adams style. Please explain how you got the picture to look this way. I''ve been trying for ages to get this perfect exposure/contrast/dof/clouds etc.', '2007-06-07 17:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752653, 529123, 78062, '<td valign="top">Because of the cholrophyll...</td>', 'Because of the cholrophyll...', '2007-06-07 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752657, 528781, 78062, '<td valign="top">Why what? Why is her head stuck to her knee?<br/> <br/>NO More Nails! Sticks Anything To Anything! Fact!<br/> <br/>I like your picture but I wish it were a little sharper on the face and the lighting boosted a little and a bit more saturation in the skin.</td>', 'Why what? Why is her head stuck to her knee? NO More Nails! Sticks Anything To Anything! Fact! I like your picture but I wish it were a little sharper on the face and the lighting boosted a little and a bit more saturation in the skin.', '2007-06-07 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752659, 526157, 78062, '<td valign="top">SueW?</td>', 'SueW?', '2007-06-07 17:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752663, 524761, 78062, '<td valign="top">Great symettry abd colours here.</td>', 'Great symettry abd colours here.', '2007-06-07 17:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752667, 528446, 78062, '<td valign="top">INtriguing... looks very Benetton to me.</td>', 'INtriguing... looks very Benetton to me.', '2007-06-07 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752669, 525635, 78062, '<td valign="top">I like the cards but her stance is a bit wooden.</td>', 'I like the cards but her stance is a bit wooden.', '2007-06-07 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752684, 526683, 78062, '<td valign="top">Well, simple answer is that if you weren''t jailed you would probably be shot and eaten and have your skin turned into fashion accessories for rich morons. Another answer would be that whilst this is a valiant effort on behalf of conservation, you are imprisoned as a means of paying the overheads that the owner of that cage has such as food, security, staff, surveillance equipment, advertising and a whole host of other things that a big cat probably wouldn''t understand.<br/> <br/>I''m sure you miss life on the Savannah chasing the antelope and drinking from holes and the rainy season and all that fun stuff, but here at least people take your picture and say "awwwww".</td>', 'Well, simple answer is that if you weren''t jailed you would probably be shot and eaten and have your skin turned into fashion accessories for rich morons. Another answer would be that whilst this is a valiant effort on behalf of conservation, you are imprisoned as a means of paying the overheads that the owner of that cage has such as food, security, staff, surveillance equipment, advertising and a whole host of other things that a big cat probably wouldn''t understand. I''m sure you miss life on the Savannah chasing the antelope and drinking from holes and the rainy season and all that fun stuff, but here at least people take your picture and say "awwwww".', '2007-06-07 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752688, 528890, 78062, '<td valign="top">I think this needs a lower ISO as the noise here is killing the pic, she lokos almost bruised as the bluish tones show up too mouch.</td>', 'I think this needs a lower ISO as the noise here is killing the pic, she lokos almost bruised as the bluish tones show up too mouch.', '2007-06-07 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752863, 528033, 33781, '<td valign="top">Good photograph but seems like out of context.</td>', 'Good photograph but seems like out of context.', '2007-06-07 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752869, 529017, 79242, '<td valign="top">It is a good photo of an unattractive subject. Although it fits the challenge, I cannot score it too high because....Well.....It is ugly. Good job though. 7 in my book (Well above average).<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'It is a good photo of an unattractive subject. Although it fits the challenge, I cannot score it too high because....Well.....It is ugly. Good job though. 7 in my book (Well above average). I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 18:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752876, 529234, 79242, '<td valign="top">The light is too bright. Maybe better at a different time of the day. Other than that, not bad...<br/> <br/>I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......</td>', 'The light is too bright. Maybe better at a different time of the day. Other than that, not bad... I am not a good photographer, I do not claim to be better than anyone, any criticism is meant to be constructive criticism......', '2007-06-07 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
