(3760129, 528864, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and your post processing is incredible.  I will be watching to see where this ends up.  Wonderful photograph.</td>', 'Nicely composed and your post processing is incredible.  I will be watching to see where this ends up.  Wonderful photograph.', '2007-06-09 12:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760133, 528286, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the texture effect in this image.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'I love the texture effect in this image.  Nicely captured.', '2007-06-09 12:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760134, 529033, 4967, '<td valign="top">I feel that for this you could have used more dof... while this does draw my eye right to the face... I find the rest of the image lacking.</td>', 'I feel that for this you could have used more dof... while this does draw my eye right to the face... I find the rest of the image lacking.', '2007-06-09 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760138, 528470, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool building and use of shutter with the streaking light.</td>', 'Very cool building and use of shutter with the streaking light.', '2007-06-09 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760140, 528234, 1024, '<td valign="top">With shallow DOF on any type of face, its incredibly important that the eyes are in sharp focus.  You have done that nicely here.  Good capture.</td>', 'With shallow DOF on any type of face, its incredibly important that the eyes are in sharp focus.  You have done that nicely here.  Good capture.', '2007-06-09 12:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760141, 528219, 1024, '<td valign="top">Good portrait od a lovely young lady, however it is very ordinary, nothing new.</td>', 'Good portrait od a lovely young lady, however it is very ordinary, nothing new.', '2007-06-09 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760142, 528756, 4967, '<td valign="top">Love what you did with the sun here.  Could represent heavenly light - or a crown of thorns.  I also like that you chose to shoot this from the side and not the front as is typical.  I''m not sure how I feel about the direct centering... but it''s interesting.</td>', 'Love what you did with the sun here.  Could represent heavenly light - or a crown of thorns.  I also like that you chose to shoot this from the side and not the front as is typical.  I''m not sure how I feel about the direct centering... but it''s interesting.', '2007-06-09 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760143, 527591, 1024, '<td valign="top">Strange portrait.</td>', 'Strange portrait.', '2007-06-09 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760146, 528082, 1024, '<td valign="top">This could use a slight bump in contrast to help keep your whites bright and to give you some rich deep blacks.</td>', 'This could use a slight bump in contrast to help keep your whites bright and to give you some rich deep blacks.', '2007-06-09 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760147, 527987, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.  Looks good in BW.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.  Looks good in BW.', '2007-06-09 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760150, 527857, 4967, '<td valign="top">This does not look like a happy horse :-(  I would have zoomed/cropped more especially off the top... and perhaps shot this from a more dynamic less flat looking angle.</td>', 'This does not look like a happy horse :-(  I would have zoomed/cropped more especially off the top... and perhaps shot this from a more dynamic less flat looking angle.', '2007-06-09 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760153, 528056, 35947, '<td valign="top">I think a different crop would improve the composition.  Great job at getting eye level.</td>', 'I think a different crop would improve the composition.  Great job at getting eye level.', '2007-06-09 12:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
