(3770443, 526072, 60495, '<td valign="top">Tha old Shack...lol   Grew up waiting to see the aliens fly it out of here but it never seems to go away.  Isn''t it amazing to know how long this house has been around and it still looks futuristic.  Better question than why is where is the orgasmatron and does it stil work...lol</td>', 'Tha old Shack...lol   Grew up waiting to see the aliens fly it out of here but it never seems to go away.  Isn''t it amazing to know how long this house has been around and it still looks futuristic.  Better question than why is where is the orgasmatron and does it stil work...lol', '2007-06-11 22:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3770449, 526946, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but including the tracter is a distraction IMO, nice tones and I like the low angle of the shot.  6</td>', 'I like the idea but including the tracter is a distraction IMO, nice tones and I like the low angle of the shot.  6', '2007-06-11 22:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
