(3771828, 527928, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but (even though valid) your thought bubble looks like clip art.</td>', 'I like the concept, but (even though valid) your thought bubble looks like clip art.', '2007-06-12 07:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3771832, 528207, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like the tight composition here, also the effect that grainess adds, as if trying to be closer to the subjects, but still far from seeing their intimate relationship, conveyed by the title, which, by the way, I find a bit "silly" (pardon!) for not being complete with the "why", because I think these photos should have a life longer than the challenge.</td>', 'I like the tight composition here, also the effect that grainess adds, as if trying to be closer to the subjects, but still far from seeing their intimate relationship, conveyed by the title, which, by the way, I find a bit "silly" (pardon!) for not being complete with the "why", because I think these photos should have a life longer than the challenge.', '2007-06-12 07:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3771835, 528453, 48471, '<td valign="top">It''s nice that it looks like a still from a film.</td>', 'It''s nice that it looks like a still from a film.', '2007-06-12 07:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3771837, 528552, 48471, '<td valign="top">A photo with a strong message. Two extra points for smoothing the water, so that the garbage is clearly shown.</td>', 'A photo with a strong message. Two extra points for smoothing the water, so that the garbage is clearly shown.', '2007-06-12 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3771842, 528451, 48471, '<td valign="top">War victims only would make a better title and you don''t need the extra why just so that the picture fits the challenge.</td>', 'War victims only would make a better title and you don''t need the extra why just so that the picture fits the challenge.', '2007-06-12 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3771886, 528542, 54885, '<td valign="top">I love the blur of the crowd, really sets of this photo and the b &amp; W treatment is great</td>', 'I love the blur of the crowd, really sets of this photo and the b & W treatment is great', '2007-06-12 08:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772169, 528764, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I love the soft focus.  Perhaps the aspect ratio is little to tall for the width.  However, the van Gogh iris type colors of deep purple and Green are nicely juxtaposed.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I love the soft focus.  Perhaps the aspect ratio is little to tall for the width.  However, the van Gogh iris type colors of deep purple and Green are nicely juxtaposed.', '2007-06-12 09:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772172, 527974, 12611, '<td valign="top">My thoughts exactly; alternate title-its five o''clock somewhere.  I feel sorry for fellows like that.  And for the people walking down the street with ludicrous faces who have no idea that their picture is being taken.</td>', 'My thoughts exactly; alternate title-its five o''clock somewhere.  I feel sorry for fellows like that.  And for the people walking down the street with ludicrous faces who have no idea that their picture is being taken.', '2007-06-12 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772176, 526767, 12611, '<td valign="top">Man oh Mann, I love the shot.  As of the acrylic chair that is seriously worn-out.  I also love the fact that this fellow is on a tile floor, and that his Birkenstocks are in the corner, while he essentially jackknifed into the corner and is fast asleep and totally unaware of the voyeuristic snapping a shot of his prey.  Love the shot-rethink the title.</td>', 'Man oh Mann, I love the shot.  As of the acrylic chair that is seriously worn-out.  I also love the fact that this fellow is on a tile floor, and that his Birkenstocks are in the corner, while he essentially jackknifed into the corner and is fast asleep and totally unaware of the voyeuristic snapping a shot of his prey.  Love the shot-rethink the title.', '2007-06-12 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772179, 528792, 12611, '<td valign="top">Clever-while one would most likely thank one to medieval helmet?  You have been quite tricky by saying why the necktie?  Unfortunately the window kind of blows out the shot in exposure is semi-ruined.  I do like the idea of the natural light and there is a great exposure factor with respect to the Apple notebook-a different angle on the shot would yield fantastic results in my opinion.</td>', 'Clever-while one would most likely thank one to medieval helmet?  You have been quite tricky by saying why the necktie?  Unfortunately the window kind of blows out the shot in exposure is semi-ruined.  I do like the idea of the natural light and there is a great exposure factor with respect to the Apple notebook-a different angle on the shot would yield fantastic results in my opinion.', '2007-06-12 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772190, 529093, 12611, '<td valign="top">A Muppet fan- so difficult to find in today''s world.  I really like the way the blue place against the Green and the vanishing point is just below the brightest spot on the whole photo. Unfortunately the placement of the trees and buildings ruined somewhat the artistic nature of the shot.  Otherwise, great work.</td>', 'A Muppet fan- so difficult to find in today''s world.  I really like the way the blue place against the Green and the vanishing point is just below the brightest spot on the whole photo. Unfortunately the placement of the trees and buildings ruined somewhat the artistic nature of the shot.  Otherwise, great work.', '2007-06-12 09:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772195, 528576, 12611, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I most thrown on the fact that when someone makes a stupid move into a toaster with a utensil is most typically a butter knife, or steak knife. And the focus is a bit soft on this one.  Otherwise I really dig the texture of the tile and the fact that this is the cheapest toaster that you could ever possibly buy.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Perhaps I most thrown on the fact that when someone makes a stupid move into a toaster with a utensil is most typically a butter knife, or steak knife. And the focus is a bit soft on this one.  Otherwise I really dig the texture of the tile and the fact that this is the cheapest toaster that you could ever possibly buy.  Best of luck.', '2007-06-12 10:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772202, 527852, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wow-I love the excellent over sharpened severely saturated look on the photo.  I guess some people would call it high key.  All colors blends so while I love the focal point of the fireplace perhaps it is a bit to the left of the screen and should be centered upon the Golden mean.  All in all, an excellent entry.</td>', 'Wow-I love the excellent over sharpened severely saturated look on the photo.  I guess some people would call it high key.  All colors blends so while I love the focal point of the fireplace perhaps it is a bit to the left of the screen and should be centered upon the Golden mean.  All in all, an excellent entry.', '2007-06-12 10:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772210, 528946, 12611, '<td valign="top">The shot is exposed so well and the clarity is so nice that I can almost overlook the title.  The neat image really benefits the glass with the money and I keeps wandering from the upper left part of the frame to the lower right part of the frame.  Terrific-I can only expect that you will do the very well with this picture.</td>', 'The shot is exposed so well and the clarity is so nice that I can almost overlook the title.  The neat image really benefits the glass with the money and I keeps wandering from the upper left part of the frame to the lower right part of the frame.  Terrific-I can only expect that you will do the very well with this picture.', '2007-06-12 10:04:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3772218, 528542, 12611, '<td valign="top">Love this real quality and city black-and-white with a blur.  I also like the fact that you set up the homeless gentlemen in exactly the right spot in the photo.  The viewers ayes go from the blur on the left to the graffiti which is in perfect focus-amend the homeless gentlemen below were you tried to stop and look at the face which is up obscured by the figure on the right.  The whole thing makes for greater entry</td>', 'Love this real quality and city black-and-white with a blur.  I also like the fact that you set up the homeless gentlemen in exactly the right spot in the photo.  The viewers ayes go from the blur on the left to the graffiti which is in perfect focus-amend the homeless gentlemen below were you tried to stop and look at the face which is up obscured by the figure on the right.  The whole thing makes for greater entry', '2007-06-12 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772226, 526141, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a sad image.  Nice dof and composition.</td>', 'What a sad image.  Nice dof and composition.', '2007-06-12 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772229, 528614, 70514, '<td valign="top">Awesome clouds, directing line and composition.</td>', 'Awesome clouds, directing line and composition.', '2007-06-12 10:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772231, 525312, 70514, '<td valign="top">This is very cute.  It looks as if it is tilted some.</td>', 'This is very cute.  It looks as if it is tilted some.', '2007-06-12 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772234, 526463, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. you do have some issues with respect to focus on the shot.  I realize it''s a nice tight macro, and I really like a silver color of the wrapper which gives perspective to the chocolate actual size</td>', 'Excellent shot. you do have some issues with respect to focus on the shot.  I realize it''s a nice tight macro, and I really like a silver color of the wrapper which gives perspective to the chocolate actual size', '2007-06-12 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772242, 528916, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent color.  Great use of negative space.  However, it could be best perhaps cropped in a horizontal/landscape fashion.  I really dig the placement of the body and the way that lightest spot and all photo is directly above the person in the photo in the horizontal parallel lines pointing right at that person.  This creates a lot of drama.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent color.  Great use of negative space.  However, it could be best perhaps cropped in a horizontal/landscape fashion.  I really dig the placement of the body and the way that lightest spot and all photo is directly above the person in the photo in the horizontal parallel lines pointing right at that person.  This creates a lot of drama.  Nice work.', '2007-06-12 10:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772273, 526618, 12611, '<td valign="top">I really have come to appreciate the fine art of pet portraits-especially that of the feline persuasion. cats have such a regal and Majestic look to them-full  of intrigue and mystery. The Japanese might call that yugain- the quality of staring into a puddle or into a forest that seems endless.  I think you really have something with respect to this CAT portrait.  This CAT has beautiful jewel like eyes.  I hope you score well in this challenge</td>', 'I really have come to appreciate the fine art of pet portraits-especially that of the feline persuasion. cats have such a regal and Majestic look to them-full  of intrigue and mystery. The Japanese might call that yugain- the quality of staring into a puddle or into a forest that seems endless.  I think you really have something with respect to this CAT portrait.  This CAT has beautiful jewel like eyes.  I hope you score well in this challenge', '2007-06-12 10:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772280, 528618, 70514, '<td valign="top">The processing really adds punch to this, imo.  Very nice composition and angle.</td>', 'The processing really adds punch to this, imo.  Very nice composition and angle.', '2007-06-12 10:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772283, 526795, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and contrasting colors and textures.</td>', 'I love the angle and contrasting colors and textures.', '2007-06-12 10:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772287, 528542, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stop in time.  Great composition and focus on the subject.</td>', 'Wonderful stop in time.  Great composition and focus on the subject.', '2007-06-12 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772288, 528975, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great detail and emotion.   I ask why also.  Very sad and true.</td>', 'Great detail and emotion.   I ask why also.  Very sad and true.', '2007-06-12 10:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772291, 526463, 70514, '<td valign="top">The shadows distract me and it seems a bit soft.</td>', 'The shadows distract me and it seems a bit soft.', '2007-06-12 10:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772293, 528200, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wow.  In the whole scheme of things against its pretty scary to think that there actually bugs that look like this.  I do like to focus, exposure and composition on this photo.  best Of luck with your entry.</td>', 'Wow.  In the whole scheme of things against its pretty scary to think that there actually bugs that look like this.  I do like to focus, exposure and composition on this photo.  best Of luck with your entry.', '2007-06-12 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772295, 528953, 70514, '<td valign="top">Well, after giggling at this image, I actually looked at it. Very nice composition and detail.  Great combo!</td>', 'Well, after giggling at this image, I actually looked at it. Very nice composition and detail.  Great combo!', '2007-06-12 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772300, 527626, 70514, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit too blue for my taste.  The image of the broken doll though is quite sad.  Nice composition and emotion.</td>', 'The image is a bit too blue for my taste.  The image of the broken doll though is quite sad.  Nice composition and emotion.', '2007-06-12 10:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
