(3772310, 528997, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice candid. It truly is a nasty habit you have depicted it so well on a screen that it gives a sort of nobility to smoking.  I am quite certain that he did not intend this however is a great photo and I wish you the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice candid. It truly is a nasty habit you have depicted it so well on a screen that it gives a sort of nobility to smoking.  I am quite certain that he did not intend this however is a great photo and I wish you the best in this challenge.', '2007-06-12 10:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
