(3772320, 528262, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is really nice.  You have really great bunch of elements here-the overgrowing weeds, the sundress, the inappropriate heels which make for excellent title, and the only part is somewhat questionable as the upper right-hand to the photo at which we are left staring at hair and grass and no true focal point. I think that you will score really well at this photo because of the nice collars and placement of the body.  As the l best of luck to you.</td>', 'I think the photo is really nice.  You have really great bunch of elements here-the overgrowing weeds, the sundress, the inappropriate heels which make for excellent title, and the only part is somewhat questionable as the upper right-hand to the photo at which we are left staring at hair and grass and no true focal point. I think that you will score really well at this photo because of the nice collars and placement of the body.  As the l best of luck to you.', '2007-06-12 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772322, 528207, 70514, '<td valign="top">The grain is really cool with the lighting and colors, but the actual image of the flowers seems oof, or too soft.</td>', 'The grain is really cool with the lighting and colors, but the actual image of the flowers seems oof, or too soft.', '2007-06-12 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
