(3772327, 528040, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors in this photo.  Excellent placement the raft as it comes down the river.  Such a feeling of excitement and movement-brilliant use of color against Granite-like sandy water. And finally, the blurry rocks in the background actually add to the nice smooth texture in juxtapose quite well against the colorful raft and the washy river.  Best of luck with his photograph.</td>', 'Nice bright colors in this photo.  Excellent placement the raft as it comes down the river.  Such a feeling of excitement and movement-brilliant use of color against Granite-like sandy water. And finally, the blurry rocks in the background actually add to the nice smooth texture in juxtapose quite well against the colorful raft and the washy river.  Best of luck with his photograph.', '2007-06-12 10:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772330, 527974, 70514, '<td valign="top">A bit funny and VERY sad.  I''d want a beer too.  Reality of our world.  Great subject and composition.  Love this in b/w.</td>', 'A bit funny and VERY sad.  I''d want a beer too.  Reality of our world.  Great subject and composition.  Love this in b/w.', '2007-06-12 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772331, 529079, 12611, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of good aspects in his photograph but there generally ruined by lack of the true focal point to which the viewer can hang her hat on.  Perhaps the best aspect of the photo is that awesome tree in the background.  That''s really the saving grace in this one.</td>', 'There are a lot of good aspects in his photograph but there generally ruined by lack of the true focal point to which the viewer can hang her hat on.  Perhaps the best aspect of the photo is that awesome tree in the background.  That''s really the saving grace in this one.', '2007-06-12 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772332, 528916, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines and isolation of your subject.</td>', 'Nice leading lines and isolation of your subject.', '2007-06-12 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772339, 529306, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent command of space.  You really know how to bring the eye into that yellow flower and then make VI switch to the upper right side of the photograph where there is a blurriness and I must admit because I do not know what that blurriness is that I find it a little disconcerting and it takes away from the message of the photo.  Perhaps it is my own idiosyncrasies which do not let me figure out what that is-a garden hose-a pot? You certainlywill score well no doubt and rightly so.</td>', 'Excellent command of space.  You really know how to bring the eye into that yellow flower and then make VI switch to the upper right side of the photograph where there is a blurriness and I must admit because I do not know what that blurriness is that I find it a little disconcerting and it takes away from the message of the photo.  Perhaps it is my own idiosyncrasies which do not let me figure out what that is-a garden hose-a pot? You certainlywill score well no doubt and rightly so.', '2007-06-12 10:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772343, 529247, 12611, '<td valign="top">The first thing that comes to mind here is the honesty associated with the photo here, although there is a blatant attempt at an artsy look within the photo context, there is certainly no overt attempt to use makeup or neat image to give a glamorous look to the shot. Because of the eye and nose in lips you understand that the photographer, via the title, is certainly in love with This person and feeling and the heart shows through with this photograph. in that sense, it''s one of the best photos in this challenge.</td>', 'The first thing that comes to mind here is the honesty associated with the photo here, although there is a blatant attempt at an artsy look within the photo context, there is certainly no overt attempt to use makeup or neat image to give a glamorous look to the shot. Because of the eye and nose in lips you understand that the photographer, via the title, is certainly in love with This person and feeling and the heart shows through with this photograph. in that sense, it''s one of the best photos in this challenge.', '2007-06-12 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3772347, 528926, 70514, '<td valign="top">Exactly my question every time I see images like this.  Although this one looks like there was a fire?  Very sad nonetheless.</td>', 'Exactly my question every time I see images like this.  Although this one looks like there was a fire?  Very sad nonetheless.', '2007-06-12 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
