(3772361, 528900, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent humor in this photo, perhaps you need to be of the Bugs Bunnie generation to get this one.  Perhaps the only thing that doesn''t work is the ass end of the Thunderbird in the photo. The kind of looks like an old west  shot until you put the element in there and once it is in there your mind starts looking at the car which is in focus. I can appreciate the fantastic sky and the luck of the mule/donkey.  Perhaps after the challenges done you can go back and removed the wires in the sky with Photoshop and, also, remove the car out of the photo.  I would love to see that.</td>', 'Excellent humor in this photo, perhaps you need to be of the Bugs Bunnie generation to get this one.  Perhaps the only thing that doesn''t work is the ass end of the Thunderbird in the photo. The kind of looks like an old west  shot until you put the element in there and once it is in there your mind starts looking at the car which is in focus. I can appreciate the fantastic sky and the luck of the mule/donkey.  Perhaps after the challenges done you can go back and removed the wires in the sky with Photoshop and, also, remove the car out of the photo.  I would love to see that.', '2007-06-12 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
