(3774287, 526278, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mirror, mirror, everywhere?  And reflections of things that aren''t in what I thought was the reality bit.  Interesting decorating scheme.  Pic looks a little washed out and there is a noticeable haze in the center on the right.</td>', 'Mirror, mirror, everywhere?  And reflections of things that aren''t in what I thought was the reality bit.  Interesting decorating scheme.  Pic looks a little washed out and there is a noticeable haze in the center on the right.', '2007-06-12 19:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3774304, 527918, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute idea; looks like extreme noise reduction (via NeatImage or equivalent) was used and I find that disorienting.  I expect focus to be the same for everything based on horizontal distance from the camera, so maybe areas around the sign would all be in focus while those in front of and behind it would not be.  The blurring occurs rather randomly so it''s not at all clear to me where the focus really was.</td>', 'Cute idea; looks like extreme noise reduction (via NeatImage or equivalent) was used and I find that disorienting.  I expect focus to be the same for everything based on horizontal distance from the camera, so maybe areas around the sign would all be in focus while those in front of and behind it would not be.  The blurring occurs rather randomly so it''s not at all clear to me where the focus really was.', '2007-06-12 19:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3774305, 527586, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get identical comments, but I have to say it anyway: wouldn''t Murphy''s Law mean buttered side down?  Anyway, great idea and I love the PP.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get identical comments, but I have to say it anyway: wouldn''t Murphy''s Law mean buttered side down?  Anyway, great idea and I love the PP.', '2007-06-12 19:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
