(3775059, 528990, 61961, '<td valign="top">I see many things that could use improvement.  Mainly you need sharper focus on the bird.  It would also help to have the bird facing the camera (waiting for those moments is part of photography).  There is a "horizon" line of sorts dividing the photo in half -- it is generally considered poor composition to put your horizon at center.  Hope these help!</td>', 'I see many things that could use improvement.  Mainly you need sharper focus on the bird.  It would also help to have the bird facing the camera (waiting for those moments is part of photography).  There is a "horizon" line of sorts dividing the photo in half -- it is generally considered poor composition to put your horizon at center.  Hope these help!', '2007-06-12 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
