(3778410, 528453, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I love the color palette, the faded reds in the bouquet and on her face and nails.  Not sure what I''m looking at frame left (the black blob) and right (the magnified red).  Are you shooting through glass?  Did you overlay a filter?  Anyway, a very interesting photo that nails the theme to boot.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I love the color palette, the faded reds in the bouquet and on her face and nails.  Not sure what I''m looking at frame left (the black blob) and right (the magnified red).  Are you shooting through glass?  Did you overlay a filter?  Anyway, a very interesting photo that nails the theme to boot.', '2007-06-13 12:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
