(3781120, 527905, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.  A real pleasure to view. That fish-eye really pulls together so many elements, each of which is stunning.  (Excellent use of it).</td>', 'Very nice indeed.  A real pleasure to view. That fish-eye really pulls together so many elements, each of which is stunning.  (Excellent use of it).', '2007-06-14 01:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781140, 526150, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good to see you with a new PB, Joe!  In the UK, logging is controlled by a     government body, The Forestry Commission; only a certain percentage of a wood or forest can be felled at a time and a nature corridor has to be left so that wildlife can move on to a new area.</td>', 'Good to see you with a new PB, Joe!  In the UK, logging is controlled by a     government body, The Forestry Commission; only a certain percentage of a wood or forest can be felled at a time and a nature corridor has to be left so that wildlife can move on to a new area.', '2007-06-14 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781153, 528946, 65025, '<td valign="top">Tate!!!! this shot is soo awesome...it''s meaningful (Really, who should have to pay for water??!!!???) and it''s well done!</td>', 'Tate!!!! this shot is soo awesome...it''s meaningful (Really, who should have to pay for water??!!!???) and it''s well done!', '2007-06-14 01:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
