(3781465, 528260, 76430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giega:</b></div><hr/><i> Is it a reference to George Mallory and Everest? Nicely done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>By George you''re right, giega.  My mistake on the Hillary reference.  This was one of my top rated pictures.  Sorry it didn''t score higher overall.</td>', 'Originally posted by giega: Is it a reference to George Mallory and Everest? Nicely done.  By George you''re right, giega.  My mistake on the Hillary reference.  This was one of my top rated pictures.  Sorry it didn''t score higher overall.', '2007-06-14 02:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781468, 526622, 53536, '<td valign="top">I never expected I would earn my very first ribbon.  This photo was taken in my home studio using a single softbox and a black background to achieve a dramatic low key effect. Now that this image won a ribbon, I am going to print a copy, frame it and give it to her as  birthday present.<br/> <br/>Many thanks to all for your kind comments.<br/></td>', 'I never expected I would earn my very first ribbon.  This photo was taken in my home studio using a single softbox and a black background to achieve a dramatic low key effect. Now that this image won a ribbon, I am going to print a copy, frame it and give it to her as  birthday present. Many thanks to all for your kind comments.', '2007-06-14 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781517, 527591, 41337, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t the smoke be coming out of his other ear?</td>', 'Shouldn''t the smoke be coming out of his other ear?', '2007-06-14 02:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
