(3781646, 528946, 62925, '<td valign="top">As much as I agree you do know that only 3% of the water in our world is drinkable right? and most of that drinkable water is in form of ice or in ground water in aquifers(squishy underground rock). So it is hard to get drinkable water so that is why we pay. <br/>I think its sad how much water we waste in North America, with our 30 min showers and all that, which is also why we pay so much for our water.</td>', 'As much as I agree you do know that only 3% of the water in our world is drinkable right? and most of that drinkable water is in form of ice or in ground water in aquifers(squishy underground rock). So it is hard to get drinkable water so that is why we pay. I think its sad how much water we waste in North America, with our 30 min showers and all that, which is also why we pay so much for our water.', '2007-06-14 02:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
