(3781808, 528925, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice finish.  Glad to see you back. ;~D</td>', 'Nice finish.  Glad to see you back. ;~D', '2007-06-14 02:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781869, 528228, 78303, '<td valign="top">It was a test that failed.  I have learned from it.  The funniest thought is that it actually received one vote from each score on the chart.  So, the hatred of it is not universal.<br/> <br/>I liked the dreamy look, which made me try reading all the papers, with the words on them.  Upon reflection, I think a less exposed, closer shot, maybe on a different backdrop (not a white board) would have been better.<br/> <br/></td>', 'It was a test that failed.  I have learned from it.  The funniest thought is that it actually received one vote from each score on the chart.  So, the hatred of it is not universal. I liked the dreamy look, which made me try reading all the papers, with the words on them.  Upon reflection, I think a less exposed, closer shot, maybe on a different backdrop (not a white board) would have been better. ', '2007-06-14 03:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781973, 528446, 66353, '<td valign="top">Well done and well deserved (well, actually it deserved something even better)</td>', 'Well done and well deserved (well, actually it deserved something even better)', '2007-06-14 03:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3782017, 529067, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well Peter, ''congratulations'' (it seems like a terribly in appropriate term in the circumstances) on ''coming out''.  MS like ny illness is not something to be ashamed of.  I wish you all the best in your battle against this illness and just to let you know you have plenty of buddies here on DPC if you ever fancy a chat or just to unload to someone.<br/> <br/>Nice image, made more poignant by the story...Gotta say that background is Ummmmmm ORANGE</td>', 'Well Peter, ''congratulations'' (it seems like a terribly in appropriate term in the circumstances) on ''coming out''.  MS like ny illness is not something to be ashamed of.  I wish you all the best in your battle against this illness and just to let you know you have plenty of buddies here on DPC if you ever fancy a chat or just to unload to someone. Nice image, made more poignant by the story...Gotta say that background is Ummmmmm ORANGE', '2007-06-14 04:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3782019, 527018, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, to a ''Limey'' like myself this is what the States is all about, a beautiful big country...Not sure whether I could have left such a picturesque area myself.  Lovely job in capturing its natural beauty and great composition</td>', 'Lovely shot, to a ''Limey'' like myself this is what the States is all about, a beautiful big country...Not sure whether I could have left such a picturesque area myself.  Lovely job in capturing its natural beauty and great composition', '2007-06-14 04:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3782023, 529283, 68035, '<td valign="top">They look like ancient prison cells....which given you live in Australia...  &lt;&lt; Sits back and waits for bricks etc to be hurled my way&gt;&gt;<br/> <br/>Love the range of tones and textures here and I am gald the majority of people did get the Why</td>', 'They look like ancient prison cells....which given you live in Australia...  << Sits back and waits for bricks etc to be hurled my way>> Love the range of tones and textures here and I am gald the majority of people did get the Why', '2007-06-14 04:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3782028, 528952, 68035, '<td valign="top">Jack, good strong crisp image, subtle enough to make you think but not so abstract to be totally obscure.  Would make a great anti drink drive advert in a style magazine (which hopefully you realise by now is meant as a compliment)<br/>Good job</td>', 'Jack, good strong crisp image, subtle enough to make you think but not so abstract to be totally obscure.  Would make a great anti drink drive advert in a style magazine (which hopefully you realise by now is meant as a compliment)Good job', '2007-06-14 04:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3782039, 528285, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sevil<br/> <br/>I came to love your black and white candid shotes so much in the recent 30 day challenge but this almost tops them all.  Lovely image and - as ever - your tones and contrasts are magnificent.<br/> <br/>Love the fact that there appears to be a giant pencil on the left of the frame....What the heck is that about!!!!  It adds a wonderful touch of surrealism to the shot</td>', 'Sevil I came to love your black and white candid shotes so much in the recent 30 day challenge but this almost tops them all.  Lovely image and - as ever - your tones and contrasts are magnificent. Love the fact that there appears to be a giant pencil on the left of the frame....What the heck is that about!!!!  It adds a wonderful touch of surrealism to the shot', '2007-06-14 04:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
