(3783147, 528285, 50641, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent score for a non-dpc photo.  I love the mess here - the downed cone, the graffiti, the belly-scratching - I''d be wearing those expressions there too!  (In fact, I think I did when I lived in the east village!) It''s not in your face sympathetic like a dirty child,  it''s very documentary - there is no fantasy.  No cropping of a depressing existence.  No pretty dirt.  Damn well done.</td>', 'Pretty decent score for a non-dpc photo.  I love the mess here - the downed cone, the graffiti, the belly-scratching - I''d be wearing those expressions there too!  (In fact, I think I did when I lived in the east village!) It''s not in your face sympathetic like a dirty child,  it''s very documentary - there is no fantasy.  No cropping of a depressing existence.  No pretty dirt.  Damn well done.', '2007-06-14 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
