(3786621, 528787, 62318, '<td valign="top">Ouch, snapshot of death comment. I hate those. I think it is a good picture for why, at least his expression seems to convey the thought. Most of the entries to me at least were just normal pictures with a catchy title. At least this fits.</td>', 'Ouch, snapshot of death comment. I hate those. I think it is a good picture for why, at least his expression seems to convey the thought. Most of the entries to me at least were just normal pictures with a catchy title. At least this fits.', '2007-06-15 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3786744, 529307, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and thanks for the explanation in your comments. The only distraction for me is the yellow background, if it was a dirtier yellow like the star it might work but it looks too cheerful. I like the darkness of the shot and would have liked to see that in the background as well. Even cropping it to the shoulder line might work. But a really good emotive image. Just my 2 cents.</td>', 'I love the idea and thanks for the explanation in your comments. The only distraction for me is the yellow background, if it was a dirtier yellow like the star it might work but it looks too cheerful. I like the darkness of the shot and would have liked to see that in the background as well. Even cropping it to the shoulder line might work. But a really good emotive image. Just my 2 cents.', '2007-06-15 01:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3786767, 529307, 50695, '<td valign="top">sorry I skipped the Why challenge, or I surely would have commented. I notice the subject is gone into darkness. As far as we know, he is only his clothing. the spotlight on the star is less subtle than I like, as you might have guessed, but I do like the use of icons.</td>', 'sorry I skipped the Why challenge, or I surely would have commented. I notice the subject is gone into darkness. As far as we know, he is only his clothing. the spotlight on the star is less subtle than I like, as you might have guessed, but I do like the use of icons.', '2007-06-15 01:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
