(3787718, 527006, 70689, '<td valign="top">Well, what can I say. The picture is about what I wanted it to be. Anything not-so-pretty was meant to be not-so-pretty. Not-so-pretty just doesn''t work at DPC I guess. But some of the comments maken me wonder: BAMartin notices wrinkles on the background and kotzie the stain on the table cloth. How can both of them have missed the huge stain on the background?<br/> <br/>By the way, it''s not a background. It''s a t-shirt. I am wearing it (no, not right now). It''s just you looking at me on our romantic dinner date. Nice tits you got bird. Fancy having a pint after we finished this?<br/> <br/>;-)</td>', 'Well, what can I say. The picture is about what I wanted it to be. Anything not-so-pretty was meant to be not-so-pretty. Not-so-pretty just doesn''t work at DPC I guess. But some of the comments maken me wonder: BAMartin notices wrinkles on the background and kotzie the stain on the table cloth. How can both of them have missed the huge stain on the background? By the way, it''s not a background. It''s a t-shirt. I am wearing it (no, not right now). It''s just you looking at me on our romantic dinner date. Nice tits you got bird. Fancy having a pint after we finished this? ;-)', '2007-06-15 09:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
