(3788704, 527852, 60505, '<td valign="top">Why such delapidation? Here there is a history of migration from very poor isolated rural area to urban life, resulting in abandoned houses. Usually these houses are dark and drab, but the thatched roof must have fallen in, allowing this great photo to be taken. House furniture is 1940-50''s but probably lived in until just a few years ago, the green ceiling paint is neat!  Love the colors ad saturation. Rural Ireland is such a great place to photograph. Thanks for the memories.</td>', 'Why such delapidation? Here there is a history of migration from very poor isolated rural area to urban life, resulting in abandoned houses. Usually these houses are dark and drab, but the thatched roof must have fallen in, allowing this great photo to be taken. House furniture is 1940-50''s but probably lived in until just a few years ago, the green ceiling paint is neat!  Love the colors ad saturation. Rural Ireland is such a great place to photograph. Thanks for the memories.', '2007-06-15 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3788722, 529319, 60505, '<td valign="top">10 out of 10 for the title, made me look again and enjoy the moment. That''s what dpc is about, not the perfect noiseless image. The expressions fit perfectly. Well done. should have done better IMHO.</td>', '10 out of 10 for the title, made me look again and enjoy the moment. That''s what dpc is about, not the perfect noiseless image. The expressions fit perfectly. Well done. should have done better IMHO.', '2007-06-15 16:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
