(3789579, 529067, 66597, '<td valign="top">Peter, I''m glad you shared this entry with the DPC community - and I think you portrayed it very well. Some people commented that your bg is too "bright" or "distracting" but I think it fits very well. I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given you at least an 8. This is an entry that actually makes the viewer think.</td>', 'Peter, I''m glad you shared this entry with the DPC community - and I think you portrayed it very well. Some people commented that your bg is too "bright" or "distracting" but I think it fits very well. I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given you at least an 8. This is an entry that actually makes the viewer think.', '2007-06-15 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
