(3790348, 529307, 66384, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe that such a beautiful photo with such a poignant reminder didn''t score higher than 5.3. This is truly a photo to make you proud. <br/> <br/>I love the bright yellow background and the glow on the collar and shoulder. The dark shirt and jacket are just visible enough and really demonstrate how the individual would be lost behind the star.<br/> <br/>I think this is an important work of art that would probably be especially well received by the right audience. Get yourself a nice big beautiful print from DPCPrints, and don''t skimp on the framing.</td>', 'I cannot believe that such a beautiful photo with such a poignant reminder didn''t score higher than 5.3. This is truly a photo to make you proud.  I love the bright yellow background and the glow on the collar and shoulder. The dark shirt and jacket are just visible enough and really demonstrate how the individual would be lost behind the star. I think this is an important work of art that would probably be especially well received by the right audience. Get yourself a nice big beautiful print from DPCPrints, and don''t skimp on the framing.', '2007-06-16 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
