(3793539, 528044, 39057, '<td valign="top">Yes...to me it does matter. She may be Muslim. I was wondering if she was involved in any of the wars that Muslims were killing other Muslims because they pray at a different type Mosque.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by njsabs2323:</b></div><hr/><i> <i>What war was she involved in? <br/> <br/>Nice photo as has been said, although I would find it a little odd to dress up a model as a child of war. <br/> </i> <br/> <br/>The point of the photograph is to capture a question of WHY????  I asked myself....why are their children of war?  Does it really matter what war they are in? </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-17 10:46:14.</i></td>', 'Yes...to me it does matter. She may be Muslim. I was wondering if she was involved in any of the wars that Muslims were killing other Muslims because they pray at a different type Mosque. Originally posted by njsabs2323: What war was she involved in?  Nice photo as has been said, although I would find it a little odd to dress up a model as a child of war.    The point of the photograph is to capture a question of WHY????  I asked myself....why are their children of war?  Does it really matter what war they are in? ', '2007-06-17 11:41:14.000000', '2007-06-17 11:46:14.000000', 0),
