(3807269, 528781, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the desat and the mood you explain you''re trying to impress on viewers I think comes through a bit though maybe a bit too subtle.  Once thing that would probably improve the image is to increase the contrast.  This would bring more attention to the face and the model''s expression.</td>', 'I like the desat and the mood you explain you''re trying to impress on viewers I think comes through a bit though maybe a bit too subtle.  Once thing that would probably improve the image is to increase the contrast.  This would bring more attention to the face and the model''s expression.', '2007-06-20 11:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3807276, 528781, 32767, '<td valign="top">Her pose is an uncomfortable one, especially for such a tight crop. Her face which I assume is the main part of the subject is in the shadow. In other words the lighting balance dioesn''t really work IMHO.</td>', 'Her pose is an uncomfortable one, especially for such a tight crop. Her face which I assume is the main part of the subject is in the shadow. In other words the lighting balance dioesn''t really work IMHO.', '2007-06-20 11:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3807378, 528781, 58728, '<td valign="top">Just read your post...thought I would leave a comment...   I think that it''s an interesting shot.  She definitely has an intruiging look on her face.  I think the reason it got voted lower is because her eyes are in the shadows, and her face is a bit out of focus.  Hope this helps a bit. ~Magen</td>', 'Just read your post...thought I would leave a comment...   I think that it''s an interesting shot.  She definitely has an intruiging look on her face.  I think the reason it got voted lower is because her eyes are in the shadows, and her face is a bit out of focus.  Hope this helps a bit. ~Magen', '2007-06-20 11:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3807428, 528781, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the pose and the slight desat of colors.  I would have given this a 6 as it is.  If the face had been a little more in focus (it looks out of focus here rather than soft focus) I would have given it a 7.  I think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the pose and the slight desat of colors.  I would have given this a 6 as it is.  If the face had been a little more in focus (it looks out of focus here rather than soft focus) I would have given it a 7.  I think it meets the challenge.', '2007-06-20 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3807507, 528781, 46700, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a common problem in all three photos you posted about.  First off would be the lack of sharp focus.  If you were going for a soft focus look, you need to start with a sharp image.  By looking at your settings, you use a very small aperature when you could use a much larger and get faster shutter speeds giving sharp results.  There is a lack of contrast/flat light.  Last major problem would be the darkness around the faces.  On this photo, fill flash would have made the subject pop much more while still maintaining your mood.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'You seem to have a common problem in all three photos you posted about.  First off would be the lack of sharp focus.  If you were going for a soft focus look, you need to start with a sharp image.  By looking at your settings, you use a very small aperature when you could use a much larger and get faster shutter speeds giving sharp results.  There is a lack of contrast/flat light.  Last major problem would be the darkness around the faces.  On this photo, fill flash would have made the subject pop much more while still maintaining your mood.   ', '2007-06-20 12:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3807746, 528781, 14736, '<td valign="top">I like the soft lighting here, but other than being a nice portrait it is a little uninteresting.  It would be an even better portrait if her face was in focus and not her ponytail/bun thing on the back of her head.</td>', 'I like the soft lighting here, but other than being a nice portrait it is a little uninteresting.  It would be an even better portrait if her face was in focus and not her ponytail/bun thing on the back of her head.', '2007-06-20 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
