(3824756, 529247, 48389, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail here and the composition is perfect. Converting to B&amp;W some how suits the ''feel'' of this image but I would agree with one of your commenters about parts being a little overexposed - mainly the earring for me...but, this could be intentional! I''m not sure why this didn''t score higher as to me it''s a well taken image...I''ll never understand the DPC voters! :o)</td>', 'I really like the detail here and the composition is perfect. Converting to B&W some how suits the ''feel'' of this image but I would agree with one of your commenters about parts being a little overexposed - mainly the earring for me...but, this could be intentional! I''m not sure why this didn''t score higher as to me it''s a well taken image...I''ll never understand the DPC voters! :o)', '2007-06-23 15:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
